# Separate integrated spawn diagnostic gate

Only `git_cpu_spawn.py BUILD_LABEL NEW_LABEL --spawn-frames` connects the
model-tested [spawn boundaries](spawn-frames-design.md). It retains intent in
an exclusive new root before lazy imports, schema checks and all original
preflights. The original `git_cpu_overhead.py` and its default/outer/leaf modes
are unchanged. The model schema and historical packets retain their original
meaning; integrated output uses `hc074-spawn-capture-v1` instead.

The new measure body substitutes only the specialized Job factory with its
extra recorder and adds final spawn attachment. Restricted AST comparison joins
it back to the exact original leaf measure body. The original worker, Job
policy, argv/env/pipes, pins, source/image identity, terminal census, fixed
schedule, common 120-second origin, five-second cleanup and disk/log bounds
remain. The new API subclass uses the independently model-checked original
spawn body with literal marks only; no ownership-gap or failed-error-path
probe is added.

Operational verdict is captured before any recorder attachment. Spawn export
uses that verdict, not the verdict already narrowed by outer/leaf telemetry.
Existing operational/outer/leaf refusal wins over a later attached spawn refusal;
the spawn's own first refusal remains separately retained. This is deterministic
metadata precedence, not cross-recorder chronological ordering. Ordinary spawn
faults freeze that recorder while original effects/healthy close continue;
fatal cuts reach the original cleanup with the same Job-held child even while
the caller's child assignment is unset. No incomplete cohort is summarized.

The caller requires exact new schema, model identity, phase order, integer
probe/read budgets and true/false policy scope before constructing APIs. All
three recorder contracts are checked. Complete span capture still does not
prove resume; original deadline semantics and terminal checks remain decisive.

An exact-source offline/locked build and one local Windows native control are
the next functional gate. The Linux host cannot validate Windows CreateProcessW
or Job Objects, so no server launch is needed for this diagnostic. Both arms
trace all layers; no on/off overhead estimate, pure API attribution, V6 retry,
product workload, source optimization or production authority claim follows.
At full completion there are 544 recorder probes/1632 clock reads for sixteen
workers, with unchanged original metric/deadline reads additional.
